WEBVTT

00:00.390 --> 00:02.140
I can't find them anywhere.

00:02.140 --> 00:04.380
Succeeded in the analysis of
the digested dragon.

00:04.380 --> 00:06.070
Extracting dragon language.

00:06.070 --> 00:06.900
Huh?

00:06.900 --> 00:08.490
Setting the activation keywords.

00:08.490 --> 00:11.070
Searching with Dragon Sense
is now possible.

00:11.070 --> 00:11.910
So what?!

00:11.910 --> 00:13.610
The position of the sniper has been found.

00:13.610 --> 00:15.950
Usage of Dragon Wing recommended.

00:15.950 --> 00:17.160
Dragon Wing!

00:17.540 --> 00:19.120
What a simple name.

00:20.660 --> 00:23.540
Are you sure you want to
involve unrelated people?

00:24.140 --> 00:26.090
Riona Shirayama.

00:26.090 --> 00:27.477
(Class: Gorilla)
If I don't do something about you,

00:27.478 --> 00:30.510
(Can enhance strength by 10/100 times, and so on.)
I just wouldn't be able to sleep in peace!

00:31.510 --> 00:35.390
How strong are you compared to
the rest of the class?

00:35.660 --> 00:38.350
When it comes to hand-to-hand combat,
I'm the strongest!

00:38.350 --> 00:40.230
Dragon Claw.

00:42.420 --> 00:46.690
If that's the case, then the others
shouldn't be much of a problem.

00:46.690 --> 00:48.440
If only my abilities weren't sealed...

00:48.440 --> 00:49.780
Sealed?

00:50.210 --> 00:56.430
This area's royal family has the ability
to weaken a Gift's power.

00:57.850 --> 01:02.180
Then, let's fight again
when the seal is gone.

01:03.410 --> 01:06.020
So this is the first floor?

01:06.020 --> 01:09.820
My Lord's little sister should be
on the last floor.

01:10.170 --> 01:13.180
You don't plan on just walking
straight in there, do you?

01:13.180 --> 01:15.350
(Dark God Albagarma's Spawn)
I can leave you here if you don't like it.

01:15.350 --> 01:17.055
(Class: Healer)
If we just keep going aimlessly,

01:17.056 --> 01:19.210
(Specializes in recovery skills. Poor at adventuring.)
we'll never be able to get there...

01:20.690 --> 01:23.310
Is she an Explorer?

01:23.950 --> 01:25.157
Lady Mana?

01:25.650 --> 01:26.700
Why are you here?

01:27.320 --> 01:29.830
I thought I smelled
my dear brother's scent.

01:29.830 --> 01:33.570
But I just couldn't bear to wait,
so I decided to come up instead.

01:33.570 --> 01:36.480
Could it be that she is the one...

01:36.480 --> 01:38.040
My Lord's little sister.

01:38.040 --> 01:40.420
Excuse me?!

01:44.896 --> 01:46.896
(My Instant Death Ability is Overpowered)

01:47.962 --> 01:51.423
A single blow that stabs your heart

01:51.423 --> 01:54.593
No arguments, listen you fools

01:54.593 --> 01:58.139
A striking blow of my compelling Bars

01:58.139 --> 02:01.433
Without saying a word, you start to dance

02:01.433 --> 02:04.895
My song gets you hooked Oh...

02:04.895 --> 02:08.315
People in earshot will dance Oh...

02:08.315 --> 02:11.777
Now close your eyes Oh...

02:11.777 --> 02:15.322
No one can escape My Killer Bars

02:16.365 --> 02:19.243
Get out of my way, I'm coming through

02:19.243 --> 02:22.580
I've got this famous one verse
for 10 years now

02:22.580 --> 02:24.415
My existence is a cheat, a criminal

02:24.415 --> 02:26.292
One word and all hits critical

02:26.292 --> 02:27.793
Everyone wants this power

02:27.793 --> 02:29.753
So every time I threat like this

02:29.753 --> 02:32.715
"Those who aren't prepared, leave."

02:32.715 --> 02:36.260
The weaker goes to the pot,
this world is a feast

02:36.260 --> 02:39.805
This heaven-gift makes me unprecedented

02:39.805 --> 02:42.224
If you feel unfair, then blame the God

02:42.224 --> 02:45.519
A single blow that stabs your heart

02:45.519 --> 02:48.814
No arguments, listen you fools

02:48.814 --> 02:52.234
A striking blow of my compelling Bars

02:52.234 --> 02:55.487
Without saying a word, you start to dance

02:55.487 --> 02:58.866
My song gets you hooked Oh...

02:58.866 --> 03:02.286
People in earshot will dance Oh...

03:02.286 --> 03:05.789
Now close your eyes Oh...

03:05.789 --> 03:09.668
No one can escape My Killer Bars

03:11.960 --> 03:15.420
(Episode.10 "A Girl From the Past Appears.
Tomochika is Bewildered...")

03:16.970 --> 03:19.390
(Leader of Assassin's Guild Dark Garden.)
A request for the Assassin's Guild?

03:19.390 --> 03:21.600
(To: Ryousuke Miyanaga)
(The target's name is Yogiri Takatou...)

03:21.600 --> 03:23.810
(The inn Yogiri's group is using as a hideout)
Welcome back.

03:23.810 --> 03:26.270
Just sitting around in your room again?

03:26.270 --> 03:30.060
You think I'm just lazing here
without doing anything?

03:30.380 --> 03:31.268
Watch.

03:33.680 --> 03:34.940
What was that?

03:34.940 --> 03:36.810
I was training to hold back my power.

03:36.810 --> 03:40.950
I think it's necessary so we can get
information from the Sage.

03:40.950 --> 03:44.650
And besides that, you're just
lazing around in your room?

03:44.650 --> 03:48.200
I walked around the city.
Even ate some food while walking.

03:48.200 --> 03:51.840
Why are you just enjoying your time
in this other world by yourself?

03:51.840 --> 03:55.630
By the way, I think I was being targeted
while walking around the city.

03:56.000 --> 03:57.630
Isn't that bad?

03:57.630 --> 04:01.330
That's why, I need your help.

04:03.060 --> 04:07.020
You were sealed down here, weren't you?

04:07.020 --> 04:08.150
That's right.

04:08.150 --> 04:11.030
I don't really know the reason though.

04:11.030 --> 04:14.156
But since it was my dear brother,

04:14.157 --> 04:17.610
I must've done something wrong,
that's for certain.

04:17.610 --> 04:20.579
And yet you're able to come up here?

04:20.579 --> 04:22.780
My brother is very kind.

04:22.780 --> 04:28.000
He made such a loose seal so that
I could slip out of it whenever I wanted.

04:28.930 --> 04:30.700
- Oh, my dear brother!
- Well, that's...

04:30.700 --> 04:34.140
No, my Lord definitely put
his full strength into sealing her...

04:34.140 --> 04:35.630
By the way...

04:35.970 --> 04:38.806
I smell my brother's scent on you.

04:38.807 --> 04:42.470
Do you have his belongings with you?

04:42.750 --> 04:43.740
Yes!

04:44.700 --> 04:46.970
I've brought the key to the seal.

04:47.260 --> 04:48.430
Oh my!

04:48.430 --> 04:50.690
Oh my, my, my!

04:50.690 --> 04:52.730
How wonderful!

04:53.940 --> 04:56.004
Alright, let's go over here.

04:57.120 --> 05:01.070
Found the king's chamber and
a person who looks like the king.

05:08.250 --> 05:10.710
Who the hell are you?

05:10.710 --> 05:13.813
Are you the king of this country?

05:14.272 --> 05:16.400
Huh? And what if I am?

05:16.400 --> 05:20.800
The seal to weaken the Gift is a nuisance,
so I want you to deactivate it.

05:22.970 --> 05:24.810
Dragon Scale.

05:27.200 --> 05:28.180
Oh?

05:28.180 --> 05:30.038
Dragon Fang.

05:34.130 --> 05:37.690
He died awfully fast for someone
so confident.

05:38.020 --> 05:38.895
Hey.

05:39.422 --> 05:41.700
This guy is the king, right?

05:41.700 --> 05:42.950
Y-Yes...

05:43.620 --> 05:48.160
With the king gone,
the seal should be gone too.

05:48.160 --> 05:50.540
It's Mother!

05:50.934 --> 05:52.920
You're so beautiful as always!

05:53.193 --> 05:55.590
What are these people?

05:55.590 --> 05:57.560
Lady Mana's spawns.

05:57.560 --> 05:58.130
Huh?

05:58.468 --> 06:00.114
So cute, so cute!

06:00.114 --> 06:02.820
They are cute children of
my dear brother and me.

06:03.550 --> 06:05.230
With her own brother?!

06:05.230 --> 06:06.760
It's not like that.

06:07.110 --> 06:10.350
Those kids were born from
Lady Mana's imagination.

06:10.770 --> 06:14.310
She's a real maniac!

06:15.980 --> 06:17.877
(Class: Nurse)
I've killed the king.

06:17.877 --> 06:19.180
(Inferior to a healer,
but can heal multiple injuries.)

06:19.180 --> 06:20.250
You what?!

06:20.250 --> 06:22.440
I see your right arm is attached.

06:22.440 --> 06:24.820
Let's continue our fight, then.

06:24.820 --> 06:26.910
No! She's still...

06:26.910 --> 06:28.410
Let's do it, then!

06:28.730 --> 06:30.660
Has the seal been lifted?

06:30.660 --> 06:33.660
Why don't you see it by yourself?!

06:39.130 --> 06:41.051
I thought you were here to kill me?

06:47.090 --> 06:48.720
Dragon Fang.

06:53.480 --> 06:56.870
That seems to be it,
or do you have anything else?

06:59.730 --> 07:01.730
Dragon Tail.

07:06.740 --> 07:09.450
I guess I'll just squeeze you to death.

07:11.720 --> 07:15.790
You asked me to help, but all we're
doing is walking around the city.

07:16.290 --> 07:20.000
Just letting them target me
without resistance isn't good either.

07:20.430 --> 07:23.220
So I'll let them target me
without killing them,

07:23.220 --> 07:26.240
or kill them to identify who they are.

07:26.240 --> 07:27.380
Which one is it?

07:27.720 --> 07:29.790
You have good eyesight, right?

07:29.790 --> 07:32.480
I thought you might be able to spot them.

07:34.810 --> 07:36.970
You seem angry.

07:36.970 --> 07:38.280
Not at all.

07:38.280 --> 07:39.400
Good, then.

07:39.400 --> 07:41.540
Come on, at least ask me more!

07:41.540 --> 07:43.672
If I ask, will you tell me?

07:44.380 --> 07:48.240
I'll think about telling you
if you buy me lunch.

07:48.240 --> 07:51.140
Fine, you just want me to treat you?

07:51.140 --> 07:55.750
While we're at it,
I've got some recommendations!

07:57.490 --> 07:59.750
No. Spare me.

08:00.060 --> 08:03.500
Hurry up. Doesn't it hurt?

08:03.870 --> 08:06.510
No, I don't want to die!

08:06.510 --> 08:08.470
That's the point.

08:08.470 --> 08:10.830
You don't want to kill your target.

08:10.830 --> 08:15.900
But if you want to escape this pain,
you have to kill the target.

08:15.900 --> 08:17.180
That's the experiment.

08:20.360 --> 08:22.310
Aim for the girl this time.

08:22.310 --> 08:24.570
We haven't tried that yet, huh?

08:25.400 --> 08:27.280
Ayaka Shinozaki!

08:27.280 --> 08:30.220
I will never forgive you!

08:31.640 --> 08:33.804
There are other places we can try.

08:37.570 --> 08:38.679
What happened?

08:38.679 --> 08:41.520
I guess we should
keep on going with this route.

08:42.770 --> 08:46.030
Wait there, I'm on my way.

08:47.640 --> 08:49.050
No way!

08:49.720 --> 08:50.810
Is that the culprit?

08:50.810 --> 08:52.780
Someone's watching us.

08:52.780 --> 08:54.110
What do we do?

08:55.380 --> 08:56.400
Worry not.

08:56.400 --> 08:59.020
I got the source of
the electromagnetic waves.

08:59.380 --> 09:03.870
Maybe you're acting like this
because of all those waves going into you.

09:03.870 --> 09:04.880
You fool!

09:04.880 --> 09:08.073
I do it this time at the boy's request!

09:09.200 --> 09:11.240
Did he find me?

09:11.600 --> 09:13.740
Anyway, I must get out of here.

09:20.250 --> 09:20.710
Wha—

09:20.710 --> 09:23.600
Dannoura Style: Izuna Drop!

09:28.800 --> 09:30.650
Run and I'll kill you.

09:32.750 --> 09:36.640
You didn't run, which means
you know about my power, right?

09:36.640 --> 09:38.370
What are you talking about?

09:38.370 --> 09:40.770
Is this what you were looking for?

09:40.770 --> 09:42.360
What are you doing?

09:42.360 --> 09:46.060
A strange spirit attacked us,
so I dealt with it.

09:46.060 --> 09:49.610
That's the first time you've done
something guardian spirits would do.

09:49.610 --> 09:51.870
How could the Princess of Spirits lose?

09:51.870 --> 09:56.160
She's the ultimate spirit
who rules over all spirits!

09:56.160 --> 10:00.620
There are no spirits who can beat me.

10:00.620 --> 10:02.100
Wow.

10:02.101 --> 10:05.210
She became all cocky just because
she finally did a little something.

10:05.210 --> 10:09.920
If this one is the princess,
does that mean this is the king? Hm?

10:10.240 --> 10:11.380
What?!

10:11.710 --> 10:14.590
Can you not pick up anything strange?

10:15.198 --> 10:16.283
Made dumpling skewers!

10:17.910 --> 10:19.269
Fenrir!

10:19.820 --> 10:20.680
Die.

10:23.473 --> 10:25.590
Let's fulfill our pact.

10:25.590 --> 10:27.210
- According to our pact,
- Queen of the Dead World, Yama!

10:27.210 --> 10:29.940
all mankind will be under my control.

10:29.940 --> 10:32.250
- No, I'm not giving up yet!
- I'll give the surface dwellers a peaceful rest...

10:32.250 --> 10:35.300
- Stop it! I didn't wish for that!
- ...and guide them to the Dead World.

10:35.300 --> 10:35.820
Die.

10:42.410 --> 10:44.370
Get away from Master!

10:45.780 --> 10:47.046
Takatou!

10:48.910 --> 10:50.400
Oh, sorry.

10:50.984 --> 10:52.380
That took me by surprise.

10:54.590 --> 10:57.470
Enju, switch to Administrator
Command Mode.

10:58.220 --> 10:59.142
Deactivate.

11:05.680 --> 11:06.816
What's with her?

11:07.890 --> 11:09.310
I'll explain later.

11:14.500 --> 11:17.320
Tell me everything you know.

11:18.011 --> 11:23.016
(My Instant Death Ability is Overpowered)

11:23.016 --> 11:28.017
(My Instant Death Ability is Overpowered)

11:28.730 --> 11:30.815
Is he really invincible?

11:31.266 --> 11:34.880
He seems aloof and unemotional.

11:34.880 --> 11:37.030
(Class: Consultant) (A class that analyzes information.)
That was the impression I had.

11:37.030 --> 11:38.406
(Plotting to kill Yogiri
at the request of Sage Sion.)

11:38.840 --> 11:42.560
I'm sorry for dragging you
all the way here.

11:42.560 --> 11:44.760
Did I mishear?

11:44.760 --> 11:48.520
I can't help but feel like you just
said something honorable.

11:48.950 --> 11:50.650
No, you didn't.

11:50.650 --> 11:52.980
I said I'm sorry.

11:53.370 --> 11:57.820
Could you stop raising
an obvious death flag?

11:58.117 --> 12:00.140
This is for you.

12:00.140 --> 12:00.780
Huh?

12:01.120 --> 12:04.240
Whoever holding it will be
the representative of my Lord.

12:04.660 --> 12:07.120
Lady Mana wouldn't kill you as well.

12:07.520 --> 12:10.950
Then why don't you keep it for yourself?

12:10.950 --> 12:14.460
I mean, it's not like I want to die.

12:14.880 --> 12:17.654
I let my Lord die easily.

12:17.970 --> 12:20.340
I'm sure she will murder me.

12:20.340 --> 12:21.430
But...

12:21.720 --> 12:22.879
It's fine.

12:23.899 --> 12:27.520
Traveling with you... wasn't so bad.

12:28.650 --> 12:30.480
Please stop!

12:30.480 --> 12:34.170
That's clearly a death flag!

12:34.170 --> 12:36.190
Are you listening?!

12:37.090 --> 12:39.280
I told you everything I know!

12:39.680 --> 12:42.870
I'm not going to come after you anymore!

12:43.540 --> 12:45.348
Sorry, but you're going to die.

12:45.700 --> 12:46.950
But why?

12:46.950 --> 12:51.290
With your ability, you can create
any object from our world, right?

12:51.629 --> 12:55.380
That means you can create
as many Enju clones as you want.

12:55.380 --> 12:59.610
There are lots of people in this world
who can do the same thing!

12:59.610 --> 13:03.741
- That's why, don't kill me!
- This is just because you made me angry.

13:07.500 --> 13:09.290
Um, what is this?

13:09.290 --> 13:12.126
In order to protect me,

13:12.127 --> 13:15.190
my brother lovingly created this seal.

13:16.180 --> 13:20.030
I don't understand the meaning of a seal
you can enter and leave as you want!

13:20.620 --> 13:22.610
That's the keyhole.

13:26.320 --> 13:28.875
Her name is Enju Sumeragi.

13:29.290 --> 13:32.390
A friend I used to play with
when I was little.

13:33.250 --> 13:35.030
She is a robot, right?

13:35.030 --> 13:39.110
More accurately, it's a robot that
was made by having Enju as its model.

13:39.470 --> 13:42.405
This robot was made to kill me.

13:43.140 --> 13:47.285
I want her to be able to rest, forever.

13:49.390 --> 13:51.600
Are you misunderstanding something?

13:51.600 --> 13:52.460
Huh?

13:52.460 --> 13:55.510
You don't think Enju is dead, do you?

13:55.510 --> 13:56.610
She's not?

13:57.170 --> 13:59.130
I'm sure she's doing great right now.

14:00.050 --> 14:03.580
Probably lazing around at home
eating potato chips or something.

14:03.580 --> 14:04.490
What?!

14:04.820 --> 14:06.670
You're so misleading!

14:06.670 --> 14:10.080
What was all that talk about
letting her rest?

14:10.433 --> 14:12.502
I just meant the robot.

14:12.820 --> 14:18.730
You don't want a robot that looks like you
wandering around somewhere, right?

14:18.730 --> 14:20.590
Well, yeah...

14:21.490 --> 14:24.090
That's just something
I decided for myself.

14:24.090 --> 14:26.824
If she's fine, that's good.

14:28.290 --> 14:32.689
Fighting a dead person
would make me feel horrible.

14:33.140 --> 14:34.480
Dragon Claw.

14:39.400 --> 14:43.720
Tch. I was told that
Dragon Scale could block anything.

14:44.660 --> 14:46.620
(Class: Cook)
I am a cook.

14:46.620 --> 14:49.830
(Can cook delicious foods.)
I can slice and dice any ingredients.

14:50.260 --> 14:54.160
Aren't you interpreting
your skills too broadly?

14:54.580 --> 14:57.450
Did Yuugo hide his skill?

14:57.450 --> 14:58.630
Dragon Claw!

15:01.200 --> 15:03.402
You just cut me off without mercy, huh?

15:03.800 --> 15:06.260
Is that a Cook's skill too?

15:06.620 --> 15:11.100
A cook must be able to prepare
several dishes at once.

15:11.100 --> 15:14.670
With that explanation, you can
basically do anything you want.

15:14.670 --> 15:16.740
Don't bother to run away.

15:16.740 --> 15:20.070
I know the exact placement of
all ingredients.

15:20.360 --> 15:22.300
The fight was already decided.

15:22.300 --> 15:24.780
The flames released by Ayaka Shinozaki

15:24.781 --> 15:27.950
(Class: Reader) (Can read books in any language.)
will burn Yuugo Izumida mercilessly.

15:32.890 --> 15:34.520
Dragon Breath!

15:38.790 --> 15:40.250
What's going on here?

15:41.331 --> 15:42.170
Huh?

15:42.170 --> 15:43.670
Someone is there!

15:44.090 --> 15:45.540
Shinozaki?

15:45.540 --> 15:47.880
That's not a ghost or something, right?

15:47.880 --> 15:52.070
She has a physical body.
There's no doubt she's alive.

15:52.070 --> 15:53.900
I'm surprised you can see her from here.

15:53.900 --> 15:55.920
My eyesight is
six times better than normal.

16:00.360 --> 16:03.838
Currently, we are down to eighteen people.

16:04.590 --> 16:06.610
(Class: Idol) (Can strengthen the abilities...)
Eight of us have been killed

16:06.611 --> 16:08.740
(...of a person who has taken an oath.)
by Ayaka Shinozaki.

16:08.740 --> 16:11.470
No one could beat her?

16:11.470 --> 16:12.700
She's supposed to be dead!

16:13.150 --> 16:17.800
While it's true most of our combat power
has been focused on the Underworld,

16:17.800 --> 16:20.164
I believe the main reason
for this many victims

16:20.165 --> 16:22.520
is that she is singling out individuals.

16:22.520 --> 16:25.870
The Three Pornistocrats were wiped out
without us realizing it.

16:25.870 --> 16:29.260
Is that the only thing you care about?

16:29.260 --> 16:30.936
And just now,

16:31.362 --> 16:33.740
We have been asked to
leave the kingdom immediately.

16:33.740 --> 16:34.950
Leave?

16:34.950 --> 16:38.100
Aren't we here on Sage's orders?

16:39.330 --> 16:43.310
This kingdom will be destroyed
at this rate.

16:43.630 --> 16:46.461
To clear our objective
as fast as possible,

16:46.463 --> 16:49.592
we should all move to the Underworld!

16:51.740 --> 16:53.430
(Underworld 6th Floor)

16:53.430 --> 16:57.450
Are you here to watch us?

16:57.450 --> 16:59.430
(Vice-Captain of the Capital's castle gate guard.)
I volunteered.

16:59.430 --> 17:03.420
(A member of the royal family.)
I wanted to see the 6th floor with my own eyes.

17:03.420 --> 17:08.339
But don't push yourself too hard,
be sure to go back when you get the chance.

17:08.339 --> 17:09.380
He's right.

17:09.380 --> 17:12.970
You just have to defeat the Dark God,
and everything will be fine.

17:19.480 --> 17:22.150
There's no choice but
to press on through this.

17:22.150 --> 17:26.410
Um... There are five thousand
ninety-seven of them.

17:26.410 --> 17:28.359
I'm surprised you know
their exact numbers.

17:28.359 --> 17:31.360
(Class: Counter) (Can count any object instantly.)
My class is Counter.

17:31.360 --> 17:34.090
I'm able to know how many of them
are there in a single glance.

17:34.090 --> 17:36.597
But I'm useless in combat.

17:36.830 --> 17:38.599
(Class: General)
(Has the ability to lead and move a large number of people toward a single goal.)

17:38.599 --> 17:40.150
Siege formation!

17:45.710 --> 17:46.546
(Class: Samurai)
(Specializes in swordsmanship using Japanese swords.)

17:46.547 --> 17:47.670
(Class: Ninja)
(Specializes in combat and covert operations using ninjutsu)

17:47.670 --> 17:49.010
(Class: Death God)
(Can kill anyone instantly.)

17:50.590 --> 17:52.340
(Class: Gunslinger) (Summons firearms and their ammo,
adding special abilities as the user does it.)

17:52.340 --> 17:54.300
(Class: Saintess)
(Can purify any monster.)

18:00.560 --> 18:02.815
They aren't besieged at all!

18:04.640 --> 18:05.810
Lady Mana.

18:06.410 --> 18:09.420
There's something I need to tell you.

18:09.420 --> 18:11.150
What is it?

18:11.150 --> 18:15.240
My Lord, the Dark God Albagarma,

18:15.870 --> 18:17.763
has passed away.

18:21.020 --> 18:25.260
I know that I love
my dear brother very much,

18:25.260 --> 18:29.750
but I'm not stupid enough
to think that he will not die.

18:30.180 --> 18:35.470
Master Lute was thinking of asking you
for help in taking revenge!

18:35.470 --> 18:39.080
Of course I will take revenge.

18:39.080 --> 18:41.160
We did it, Master Lute!

18:41.160 --> 18:45.350
However, there is
something I must do first.

18:45.350 --> 18:46.440
Huh?

18:47.260 --> 18:49.730
I must give birth to my brother.

18:49.730 --> 18:52.280
Uh, I'm not sure I understand that...

18:56.910 --> 19:01.930
My dear brother's essence is still stuck
on this, so I'm going to have it.

19:01.930 --> 19:05.370
It will help bring him back.

19:08.130 --> 19:10.790
Let's take your brain next.

19:10.790 --> 19:14.090
I'm sure you remember
my dear brother's form.

19:14.090 --> 19:15.690
Please, wait!

19:15.690 --> 19:19.430
C-Could you spare Master Lute?

19:21.260 --> 19:25.890
Sure, I'll spare him, so release the seal.

19:28.610 --> 19:30.390
Administrator rights acknowledged.

19:30.390 --> 19:32.690
Full access granted.

19:38.100 --> 19:41.130
Should we really be partying like this?

19:41.130 --> 19:42.640
Why not?

19:42.640 --> 19:45.560
Well, it's been easy so far.

19:45.560 --> 19:48.960
Tomocchi,
is someone like Takatou your type?

19:48.960 --> 19:52.960
W-Why are you bringing him up
all of a sudden?

19:53.260 --> 19:55.000
(Class: Scribe)
You two are always together.

19:55.000 --> 19:58.180
(Can record and remember any event with precision.)
It would be weird not to notice.

19:58.180 --> 20:01.170
I-It's not what it looks like...

20:01.170 --> 20:03.890
Wait, where's Takatou?

20:04.280 --> 20:06.570
Uh, now that you mention it.

20:06.570 --> 20:09.850
Well, he's kind of a loner.
Maybe he doesn't want to stay in public.

20:10.170 --> 20:12.070
That's kinda mean.

20:12.990 --> 20:14.700
I'm going to look for him.

20:18.290 --> 20:20.511
Playing solo is starting to be a pain.

20:22.290 --> 20:24.570
It makes me want to
get back as soon as possible.

20:27.070 --> 20:28.561
David?

20:28.920 --> 20:31.780
Huh, are you drunk?

20:40.610 --> 20:41.930
Hey!

20:47.550 --> 20:49.190
Hello?

20:50.130 --> 20:51.667
He's completely out...

21:04.750 --> 21:06.723
(Class: Cheerleader)
What's up, Ootori?

21:06.724 --> 21:08.540
(Empowers others by cheering.)
You seem happy.

21:09.440 --> 21:14.950
Maybe it's because we've
made it to this point without a hitch.

21:17.010 --> 21:21.970
The fact that you've made it
without a hitch is the problem.

21:21.970 --> 21:23.697
(The Sage who summoned Yogiri...)
Now, then.

21:23.698 --> 21:27.810
(...and his classmates into this world.)
I thought it might have been too easy for a trial.

21:27.810 --> 21:30.890
A Sage won't be born at this rate.

21:30.890 --> 21:34.001
It's about time for an Awakening Event.

21:35.260 --> 21:36.270
So...

21:36.710 --> 21:41.240
I will have you all fight each other
until only one remains.

21:45.037 --> 21:47.164
(AΩ Second Door Open)

21:48.150 --> 21:51.500
Wait, why is the second door...

21:54.760 --> 21:56.590
Takatou!

22:20.610 --> 22:24.820
The scales swaying in the wind,
the second hand announces chaos

22:24.820 --> 22:28.320
Our truths have lost their meaning easily

22:28.320 --> 22:32.580
It's a comedy that exceeds karma,
darker than despair

22:32.580 --> 22:35.950
My tongue is dry of trivial preamble

22:35.950 --> 22:40.750
At the end of a ridiculous dream,

22:40.750 --> 22:43.840
the Arcadia was trampled down

22:43.840 --> 22:50.510
Still, it's a hazy madness
until you touch it

22:50.510 --> 22:51.720
"Lost in the Haze"

22:51.720 --> 22:55.430
Beyond this point,
neither prayer nor resolve will work

22:55.430 --> 22:59.230
Are you ready to look into the abyss?

22:59.230 --> 23:05.020
The bottom of a stomach that easily
swallows ridiculous contradictions

23:05.020 --> 23:10.740
No one will be able to escape the end

23:37.230 --> 23:38.790
"Phase 2".
